        "id": 1000187
      },
      "writtenOn": "2017-08-18T21:47:32Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Right now, cr50 is the only board using CONFIG_RDD.\n\nWhen we have a second board, we can either use the same GPIO name there, or do something more complex then.\n\nIf we don\u0027t set CCD_MODE_L, this module has no effect on the rest of the system.",
